2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] 🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.1 gemini-3.7-flash 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.008 26.93KB 2.89s
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] In Commodore PET Kernal (BASIC 2/3 and BASIC 4):
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] The default value of `$028A` (decimal `650`, labeled `RPTFLG`) is:
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] `$00` (`0`) — Normal / Default Repeat
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] Value Breakdown (`$028A` / `650`):
2026-08-18 21:12:22 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash] • `$00` (`0`) — Default: Repeat is enabled only for specific control/movement keys:
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash]   * Cursor Keys (Up, Down, Left, Right)
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash]   * `INST/DEL`
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash]   * Spacebar
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash] • `$80` (`128`): Repeat is enabled for all keys (every alphanumeric key held down
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash] will auto-repeat).
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash] • `$40` (`64`): Repeat is completely disabled for all keys.
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash] 
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash] • (Note: In BASIC, users commonly enable repeat for all keys with `POKE 650, 128` or restore
2026-08-18 21:12:23 [gemini-3.7-flash] default behavior with `POKE 650, 0`.)*
